# Opens the mark gallery (Settings, Developer details, "Mark gallery") and screenshots several poses, by test id. One `step` per line, as in files-open.steps.
# `expect <id>` means the tree has a view with that testId. Run in demo mode. The slider drags need `agent ios --touch platform` (a drag is refused without it).
# What only a device or simulator can prove: that the blades are drawn and move (the shots differ), the tumble foreshortens, the chase runs round, the
# tray's turn on the bar's mark, Reduce Motion (set it in Settings, run the last block again: the shots are still).
tap bar-pages
clock +600 real
tap pile-places
clock +600 real
tap place-settings
clock +600 real
tap settings-dev-details
clock +500 real
tap settings-mark
clock +900 real
tree
expect page-title
expect mark-gallery-main
expect mark-gallery-36
expect mark-gallery-64
expect mark-gallery-state
expect mark-motions
expect mark-motion-idle
expect mark-motion-pressed
expect mark-motion-trayOpen
expect mark-motion-trayClose
expect mark-motion-working
expect mark-motion-playing
expect mark-motion-listening
expect mark-motion-tumbling
expect mark-motion-settle
expect mark-level-0
expect mark-level-1
expect mark-slider-0
expect mark-slider-1-track
shot tetramark-rest
# The tray turn: opened, then closed (a third of a turn one way and back).
tap mark-motion-trayOpen
clock +300 real
shot tetramark-tray-opening
clock +700 real
shot tetramark-tray-open
tap mark-motion-trayClose
clock +300 real
shot tetramark-tray-closing
# The chase: working, two instants apart (each blade a third of a cycle behind the last).
tap mark-motion-working
clock +900 real
shot tetramark-working-a
clock +600 real
shot tetramark-working-b
# Tumbling in 3D: three instants, the hidden vertex comes round.
tap mark-motion-tumbling
clock +1000 real
shot tetramark-tumble-a
clock +1000 real
shot tetramark-tumble-b
clock +1000 real
shot tetramark-tumble-c
# Voice: listening at a loud level, then playing.
tap mark-level-1
tap mark-motion-listening
clock +1200 real
shot tetramark-listening-loud
tap mark-motion-playing
clock +1200 real
shot tetramark-playing
# Pressed, then back to rest without a jump.
tap mark-motion-pressed
clock +120 real
shot tetramark-pressed
tap mark-motion-settle
clock +1200 real
shot tetramark-settled
# By hand: the sliders hold a pose. Roll a third of a turn, tumble, spread the first blade.
tap mark-slider-0-track drag 100 0
clock +200 real
tree
expect mark-gallery-state
shot tetramark-slider-roll
tap mark-slider-1-track drag 120 0
clock +200 real
shot tetramark-slider-tumble
tap mark-slider-10-track drag 140 0
clock +200 real
shot tetramark-slider-spread
tap mark-motion-settle
clock +1200 real
shot tetramark-rest-again
